<title>NEW ZEALAND: Peters notes NZ growth in services, manufacturing.</title>
<headline>Peters notes NZ growth in services, manufacturing.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand Treasurer Winston Peters said on Thursday that September quarter GDP figures were ahead of market expectations.</p>
<p>&quot;I note that services and manufacturing in particular experienced solid growth,&quot; Peters said in a statement.</p>
</text>
